  "job_B1.6.1_20251001_193250": {
    "chunk_text": "Interrogatio Sigeuulfi Presbiteri. Sum ge\u00feungen lareow w\u00e6s on Engla lande Albinus gehaten, & h\u00e6fde mycele ge\u00feing\u00f0a. Se l\u00e6rde manega \u00fe\u00e6s engliscan mennisces on boclicum cr\u00e6fte, swa swa he wel cu\u00fee, & ferde sy\u00f0\u00f0an To \u00feam com Albinus se \u00e6\u00feela lareow, & on his anwealde \u00e6l\u00feeodig wunode on Sancte Martines \u00dea on sumne timan Sigewulf m\u00e6ssepreost hine befran gelome feorran mid gewritum be gehwylcum \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Albinus him to andsware, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde his axunga ealle gegaderian, & him andsware And Sigewulf hine befran \u00e6t fruman \u00feisum wordum. Hu is to understandenne \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6lmihtiga God geswac his weorca on \u00feam seofo\u00fean d\u00e6ge, \u00fea\u00fea he Albinus him andwyrde, God geswac \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6re niwan gesceapennysse, ac he geedniwa\u00f0 \u00fea ylcan Hu fela gesceadwise gesceafta gesceop God? Twa, Englas & menn. Hwi w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6ra engla synn forsuwod on \u00fe\u00e6re bec Genesis, & \u00fe\u00e6s mannes w\u00e6s ges\u00e6d? For \u00fean \u00fee God gemynte \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00fe\u00e6s mannes synne geh\u00e6lon, na \u00fe\u00e6s deofles. Hwi w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6s heah engles synn unmiltsigendlic & \u00fe\u00e6s mannes miltsigendlic? For\u00feon \u00fee se heaengel \u00fee nu is heatol deofol himsylf his synne afunde, & se man w\u00e6s beswicen. And eac swa myclum swa \u00fe\u00e6s engles gecynd mare w\u00e6s on",
